OL,3,GNEWSAHelen Jenner unveiled by Nigel
OL,4,AFarage as new leader of Reform in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has unveiled Helen Jenner
OL,7,Fas the newly-elected leader of Reform
OL,8,Fin Wales, replacing Dan Thomas after
OL,9,Fhis arrest on suspicion of assault and
OL,10,Fcontrolling or coercive behaviour.
OL,12,FSpeaking on the steps of the Senedd in
OL,13,FCardiff on Monday, Farage said: "I've
OL,14,Fknown Helen for many, many years. She
OL,15,Fis a determined campaigner."
OL,17,FFarage said he felt sorry about former
OL,18,Fleader Thomas's "personal difficulties"
OL,19,Fand that it had been untenable for him
OL,20,Fto continue, adding: "We could have
OL,21,Fdone without this bump in the road."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
